    {
      "doc_id": 4,
      "text_span": "We present our results in Figure 4. Given the strong supervision naturally available in Wikipedia HTML, it is unsurprising that CM3 shows strong, non-trivial zero-shot performance on the named entity disambiguation across a wide array of named entity disambiguation tasks.",
